y the 4th ATP No 487/2013; August 2013 August 2013 December 2013", "metadata": {"doc_id": "8f9432d2-40a4-4ad8-9fde-84c070b26e9c", "content_type": "Table", "filename": "information_requirements_r7a_en.pdf"}}